%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 24cee7e49fc532a45ab71bd5ace6cb7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: S3post
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Pwah! There it is! It's coming out!!
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uD478\uD558\uC544! \uB098\uC628\uB2E4, \uB098\uC628\uB2E4\uC544!!"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Whoa, careful! I didn't think it'd gush out like this...!
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC6B0\uC640, \uC870\uC2EC\uD574\uC694! \uC774\uB807\uAC8C \uC3DF\uC544\uC838
      \uB098\uC628\uB2E4\uB2C8...!"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Whew... Nice work. Well, I'm soaked.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uD734\uC6B0... \uC218\uACE0\uD588\uC5B4. \uC5D0\uACE0, \uB2E4
      \uC816\uC5B4\uBC84\uB838\uB124."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: That was really tough. Aaah... At least it's nice and cool.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC815\uB9D0 \uD798\uB4E4\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694. \uC544\uC544...
      \uADF8\uB798\uB3C4 \uC2DC\uC6D0\uD558\uB124\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Yeah... after being hot and exhausted all day.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB7EC\uAC8C... \uC624\uB298 \uD558\uB8E8 \uC885\uC77C
      \uB365\uACE0 \uC9C0\uCCE4\uB294\uB370."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Right now... this really is satisfying.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC774 \uC21C\uAC04\uB9CC\uD07C\uC740 \uC815\uB9D0 \uBFCC\uB4EF\uD558\uB124."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: I like it. Not quite what I expected, but...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB9C8\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uC694. \uAE30\uB300\uD588\uB358
      \uB290\uB08C\uC740 \uC544\uB2C8\uC5C8\uC9C0\uB9CC."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Whoa, look at the stars. There are so many tonight.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC6B0\uC640, \uBCC4 \uBD10\uC694. \uC624\uB298\uB530\uB77C
      \uC5C4\uCCAD \uB9CE\uB124\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Doesn't it look like someone scattered glittering sand across
      the sky?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uAF2D \uBC18\uC9DD\uC774\uB294 \uBAA8\uB798\uB97C \uBFCC\uB824\uB193\uC740
      \uAC83 \uAC19\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC544\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: With that much sand, we could probably wake a well in the sky
      too.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC800 \uC815\uB3C4\uBA74 \uD558\uB298\uC5D0\uB3C4 \uC6B0\uBB3C\uC774
      \uD558\uB098 \uB6AB\uB9AC\uACA0\uB294\uAC78."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Then it'd be nice if this "rain" thing fell, even just once.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uD55C \uBC88\uC774\uB77C\uB3C4 \uBE44\uB77C\uB294
      \uAC8C \uB0B4\uB824\uBD24\uC73C\uBA74 \uC88B\uACA0\uB124\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: That night, it was hard to tell above from below.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC624\uB298 \uBC24\uC5D4 \uC704\uC544\uB798\uAC00 \uC798 \uAD6C\uBD84\uB418\uC9C0
      \uC54A\uC558\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: Water sprang up beneath their feet, and sand glittered overhead.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBC1C\uBC11\uC5D0\uC11C\uB294 \uBB3C\uC774 \uC19F\uACE0, \uBA38\uB9AC
      \uC704\uC5D0\uC11C\uB294 \uBAA8\uB798\uAC00 \uBC18\uC9DD\uC600\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: Someday, many years from now, this night would come back to mind.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5B8\uC820\uAC00 \uC544\uC8FC \uC624\uB79C \uB4A4\uC5D0 \uC774
      \uBC24\uC744 \uB5A0\uC62C\uB9AC\uAC8C \uB420 \uAC83\uC774\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: By then, it would be clear what had begun that day.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB54C\uB294 \uC624\uB298\uC774 \uBB34\uC5C7\uC758 \uC2DC\uC791\uC774\uC5C8\uB294\uC9C0\uB3C4
      \uC54C\uAC8C \uB418\uACA0\uC9C0"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: "And the end of that story would probably\u2014"
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uADF8 \uC774\uC57C\uAE30\uC758 \uB05D\uC740
      \uC544\uB9C8\u2014"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Okay, that's enough! The end!
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC774\uC81C \uADF8\uB9CC! \uB05D!"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
